---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Create something. Follow it back to the sources. Local generation and inspectable context."/><meta name="theme-color" content="#102a34"/><title>Source Trail — Create something. Follow it back.</title><link rel="icon" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}favicon.svg`} type="image/svg+xml"/></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#lab">Skip to Story Lab</a><StoryLab client:load/><noscript>Enable JavaScript for the interactive lab.</noscript></body></html>
